ke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: none; list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:43px;\">18회 지식재산능력시험(IPAT)</span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">&lt;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">제18회 지식재산능력시험(IPAT)&gt; 공고&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">및 이와 관련한 본교 대학(원)생들에게 제공될 <strong>창의지식재산센터</strong>의&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">지원 내용</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">을 아래와 같이 공지하오니,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">학생들의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:40.0pt;margin-left:0cm;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">◈ 지식재산능력시험, IPAT&nbsp;이란?</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:40.0pt;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ한국의 대표 <strong><u>국가공인<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">&nbsp;</span></u></strong>지식재산 능력 <strong>검정시험<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">&nbsp;</span></strong>(공공기관,&nbsp;한국발명진흥회 주관)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ합격과 불합격이 없는 지식재산 분야의 토익</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">◈ 시험일정;</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ시험일:&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#B2B200;\">2019</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#B2B200;\">년&nbsp;05월&nbsp;25일(토) 11:00 ~ 12:20 (80분)</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 12pt 0cm 12pt 20pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 13px; font-family: 함초롬바탕, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif;\">ㆍ시험접수: 2019년 04월 04일(목) ~ <u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\"><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">05</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">월&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">09</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">일</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">목</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">) 18:00</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;color:#b800b8;\">까지</span></u></span></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ성적발표: 2019년&nbsp;06월&nbsp;05일(수)&nbsp;홈페이지에서 확인 가능</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">◈&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">접수방법;</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ홈페이지&nbsp;(</span><strong><a href=\"http://www.ipat.or.kr/\"></a><a class=\"fr-green\" href=\"http://www.ipat.or.kr/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">http://www.ipat.or.kr</span></a></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">)에서 접수</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">ㆍ첨부파일&nbsp;(지식재산능력시험 단체접수방법)&nbsp;참고</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:20.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#C75252;\">ㆍ단체접수를 위한 학교 인증키:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(199, 82, 82);\">kumoh18</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:40.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">※ 단체접수 시 온라인 강좌(이론1,&nbsp;이론2)&nbsp;무료</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:40.0pt;\"><br></p><hr><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#B2B200;\">◈&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#B2B200;\">창의지식재산센터 지원 내용</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:25.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(147, 101, 184);\">1)&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(147, 101, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif;\">응시료&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(147, 101, 184);\">(일부) <strong>지원</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">; 응시료 <strong>25,000원&nbsp;</strong>중 센터에서 <strong>15,000원&nbsp;</strong>지원,&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#FF843A;\">응시생 결제금액 <u>10,000원</u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:25.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#FF843A;\">&nbsp;→ <u>결제금액이 10,000원이 아닌 경우,&nbsp;</u></span><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 197, 28);\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif;\"><u>개인접수로 접수된 것</u></span></span><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#FF843A;\"><u>으로 응시료 지원 대상에서 제외됩니다.</u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:25.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(255, 132, 58);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#FF843A;\"><u>결제금액 꼭 확인해주세요!</u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:45.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">-&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">대상;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(76, 76, 76); font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">단체접수&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">후, 학생 부담 비용(10,000원)&nbsp;</span><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">결제까지 완료한</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">&nbsp;본교 대학(원)생 <strong>400명</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:45.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#666666;\">-&nbsp;접수 및 결제 여부는 지식재산능력시험 본부에서 자료를 전달받아 확인할 예정</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:45.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4646C1;\">- 결제기한까지 결제를 하지 않은 학생은 <strong><u>미응시</u></strong>로 간주하여 지원하지 않습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:45.0pt;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:25.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(147, 101, 184);\">2)&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;, serif; color: rgb(147, 101, 184);\">지식재산능력시험 대비 특강</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;color:#4C4C4C;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">총 4회 운영 예정)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,serif;color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-left:45.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;경기천년제목 Light&quot;,serif;\">-&nbsp;</span></strong><sp